TiddlyPlatypus wrote the original compass script and I'd like to thank him/her for an outstanding job.
I have taken over responsibility for this project since TiddlyPlatypus seems to have abandoned it.

The addon supports some slash commands:

/qcon		- toggles compass on/off
/qcoff		- toggles compass on/off
/qcnow		- Enable Compass this zone
/qcreset		- display Force reconfiguration of the compass
/qchelp 		- displays commands
/qcver		- display current version
/qclastap	- chat AP Earned data
/qcflashap	- briefly display the AP Earned window
/qcresetap	- reset AP Earned window

Settings can be changed in Setting/Addon Settings/Quick Compass:

1. Compass On/Off
2. 8 or 16 point compass
3. Rotations (next left and right directions)
4. Refresh rate (low, medium, high)
5. Display when in (all zones, groups, cyrodiil)
6. Enable/Disable AP Earned window
7. Enable/Disable AP Earned window background

AP Earned Window:
This displays the Alliance Points you have earned since entering Cyrodiil (or logged on if already there)
It takes into consideration any AP you spend on siege equipment etc.
It also shows the amount of AP you have earned per hour and how long you have been in Cyrodiil.
The "AP Earned" window is only displayed in Cyrodiil (use /qcflashap to briefly see it in other zones)
The AP earned is recalculated every 5 seconds or whenever AP is earned, so shouldn't cause any significant lag
